__NOTOC__
The third and final tournament under the auspices of TQA took place in early August 2004. This time it gathered a more modest representation of players from Russia, but guests from Europe came to the tournament - {{Player|DARKL0RD|flag=se}} and {{Player|ParadokS|flag=dk}}. They became the winners in both nominations. It cannot be said that the Russians did not give them any competition, the victory was achieved in a tough fight.

